# The array layout, checked at sampled element types and lengths.
axiom_array_elem	core library	Kani	trusted (partly checked, Kani: kani_proofs::ptr::array_layout_elems; not checked: the provenance clause of the element pointers, and element types and lengths other than the harness's samples (a byte, a word, a padded pair, the class table, which is this axiom's instance in `layout::regions`))
