axiom_raw_readable	raw pointer (internal)	none (assumption)
# Integers and thin pointers: every byte pattern is a valid value
# (kani::mem::can_read_unaligned checks validity: it fails at bool, plain_rejects_bool).
axiom_plain_u64	core library	Kani	discharged (Kani: kani_proofs::ptr::plain_bytes_are_values)
axiom_plain_u8	core library	Kani	discharged (Kani: kani_proofs::ptr::plain_bytes_are_values)
